msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"Oh, you're the man from before. Well? How's your progress?\r\n"
"Did anything nice happen because you can speak English now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "...You could say that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"Wonderful. And in case you didn't know, a lot of foreigners\r\n"
"live in Downtown Ryukyu... So if you can speak English, you\r\n"
"might be able to make some new friends."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"Not only that, the price of our Beginner's Handbook has\r\n"
"dropped to 10,000 yen for a limited time only."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"Our beginner's book contains even more useful daily\r\n"
"expressions. Read it once and you'll be chattering away in\r\n"
"English in no time! So, have I got your interest piqued?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"No thanks. I'm not really interested in learning any more\r\n"
"English."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"Well... I'm sorry to hear that. Before you go, I will say\r\n"
"that everyone who's bought this book has been extremely\r\n"
"satisfied with the results, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"Also, this discounted price is only for a limited time, so\r\n"
"come find me here if you change your mind!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "10,000 yen... I think this should be enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
"Perfect. Then here's your Beginner's Handbook. Why not leaf\r\n"
"through it for a bit and tell me if you have any questions?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "You paid <Color:8>10,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Beginner's English Textbook<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "(Let's see... \"Conversing with a Lost Person.\")"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"\"Ｅｘｃｕｓｅ　ｍｅ，　ｗｈｅｒｅ　ｉｓ　ｔｈｅ\r\n"
"ｓｔａｔｉｏｎ？\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"\"Ｏｈ，　ｉｔ'ｓ　ｓｔｒａｉｇｈｔ　ｔｈｉｓ\r\n"
"ｗａｙ．\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid ""
"Nice pronunciation there. Ｓｔｒａｉｇｈｔ　ｔｈｉｓ　ｗａｙ is another\r\n"
"way of saying \"down this street.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid ""
"Learning this phrase is the first step toward helping someone with "
"directions. Aren't our handbooks like hidden gems of knowledge?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid ""
"Now I hope you enjoy the course, and as we say in English...\r\n"
"Ｈａｖｅ　ａ　ｎｉｃｅ　ｄａｙ！"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "Actually, I think I'm a little short on cash. Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid ""
"Oh, that's okay. The book will be on sale all through this\r\n"
"week, so you can always come back and find me when you have\r\n"
"a little more to spend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
"Oh, you're the man from before. Have you changed your mind?\r\n"
"Do you feel like learning English now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid ""
"If you buy our Beginner's Handbook now, it'll be 10,000 yen,\r\n"
"but that's for a limited time only. How about it?"
msgstr ""

